{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_21_549512592#1_1155383399","relevance":2,"reason":"The snippet gives direct supporting evidence that lactase-deficiency symptoms can develop over time and often appear in adolescence or later, but the document is broadly about causes of intermittent diarrhea and gas rather than dedicated to whether someone can become lactose intolerant over time.","learned":"Symptoms of lactase deficiency may develop over time, usually not appearing until adolescence or later; it can also arise after small-intestine injury or disease."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"can you become lactose intolerant\" \"become lactose intolerant\" \"develop lactose intolerance\") (+ adult adults \"later in life\" suddenly))","reason":"Search for pages whose wording directly asks or answers whether someone can become lactose intolerant, especially in adulthood or later life, to find more dedicated grade-3 evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"can you become lactose intolerant\" \"become lactose intolerant\" \"develop lactose intolerance\") (+ adult adults \"later in life\" suddenly))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1356464049#0_2847731182","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q170","rank":2,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1356464049#0_2847731182\" , \"end_char\": 549.000000 , \"headings\": \"Can you <cover>suddenly become lactose intolerant?</cover>Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? 6 Answers \" , \"segment\": \"Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? | Yahoo Answers ? Lv 5 ? asked in Health Diseases & Conditions Other - Diseases · 1 decade ago Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? I rencently started having diaroherra, gas, bloating and other similar symptoms and after a bit of research I found lactose intolerant. I avoided milk products for while and the symptoms decreased. I have never had this issue with dairy before. Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? I am 16years old and female if that helps. I am also predominatly vegetarian.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? | Yahoo Answers\" , \"url\": \"https://answers.yahoo.com/question/index?qid=20081101052747AAkGeL6\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_10_1464530464#0_2388995264","rank":1,"relevance":3}]}}
