{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q170"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1356464049#7_2847738934","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q170","rank":6,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1356464049#7_2847738934\" , \"end_char\": 3289.000000 , \"headings\": \"Can you <cover>suddenly become lactose intolerant?</cover>Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? 6 Answers \" , \"segment\": \"https://shrink.im/a0cuQ Anonymous 6 years ago RE: Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? I rencently started having diaroherra, gas, bloating and other similar symptoms and after a bit of research I found lactose intolerant. I avoided milk products for while and the symptoms decreased. I have never had this issue with dairy before. Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? I am... ...Show more Source (s): suddenly lactose intolerant: https://trimurl.im/a14/can-you-suddenly-become-lac... Anonymous 1 decade ago Thetakeover83, Lactose is a larger sugar that is made up of two smaller sugars, glucose and galactose. In order for lactose to be absorbed from the intestine and into the body, it must first be split into glucose and galactose.\" , \"start_char\": 2540.000000 , \"title\": \"Can you suddenly become lactose intolerant? | Yahoo Answers"}}
