{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"can lactose intolerance\" (+ develop start appear) (+ adulthood adult \"later in life\" age))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_154644860#6_359459729","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q173","rank":4,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_154644860#6_359459729\" , \"end_char\": 3619.000000 , \"headings\": \"Can Lactose Intolerance Develop with <cover>Age? Can Lactose Intolerance Develop </cover>with Age? Symptoms Other Causes Solutions \" , \"segment\": \"Some medications also are made with lactose. Experiment with other forms of dairy. Hard cheeses and live cultured yogurt, for example, often don’t produce significant symptoms. Try over-the-counter lactase drops Before you begin any self-treatment, however, get a professional diagnosis from a New York City gastroenterologist to ensure you don’t have a more serious condition and to work out a plan for staying healthy while avoiding milk. Any and all symptoms should be diagnosed by your gastroenterologist for an accurate diagnosis and treatment plan. Book an appointment more information on how our NYC Gastroenterologists can help to treat lactose intolerance.\" , \"start_char\": 2954.000000 , \"title\": \"Can Lactose Intolerance Develop with Age? Manhattan Gastroenterology\" , \"url\": \"https://www.manhattangastroenterology.com/can-lactose-intolerance-develop-with-","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_154644860#0_359451221","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_154644860#2_359454272","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_46_154644860#1_359452739","rank":3,"relevance":3}]}}
