{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"lactose intolerant\" \"later in life\" (+ become develop developed))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_471468274#0_816370558","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q174","rank":2,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_471468274#0_816370558\" , \"end_char\": 880.000000 , \"headings\": \"Can You Become Lactose Intolerant? Can You Become Lactose Intolerant? What Causes Lactose Intolerance? Who Gets It? Can You <cover>Become Lactose Intolerant Later in Life?</cover>What Should You Do in the Meantime? How to Check If It’s Lactose Intolerance What to Do About Lactose Intolerance How to Deal with Lactose Intolerance \" , \"segment\": \"Can You Become Lactose Intolerant Later in Life? | New Health Advisor Can You Become Lactose Intolerant? Currently, over 50 percent of the population in the world is lactose intolerant. This is what happens when your lower intestine doesn't create enough lactase (and enzyme) to help process and digest the milk sugars which are called lactose. This intolerance may develop at any point in time from infancy to your golden years. It is often very challenging to diagnose as the symptoms often mimic symptoms of other conditions, including IBS or irritable bowel syndrome. Symptoms may include diarrhea, bloating, nausea, abdominal cramping and gas. What Causes Lactose Intolerance? When a person’","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_39_1165021332#0_2357098681","rank":1,"relevance":3}]}}
