{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_07_983036466#2_1729000888","relevance":3,"reason":"The Livestrong article is explicitly titled 'Is Sudden Lactose Intolerance Possible?' and directly explains that sudden lactose intolerance can occur, including secondary lactose intolerance at any age when lactase production decreases.","learned":"Sudden lactose intolerance is possible; secondary lactose intolerance can occur at any age and may be temporary or permanent when small-intestine lactase production decreases."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q185","reason":"The sudden-onset query found a directly relevant health article, so continue to retrieve more grade-3 evidence while there is remaining judgment budget."}}
